{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121426","id":4062862998,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7yKl6W","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121426","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121426.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121426.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121426","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121426/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121426/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121426/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/27d72e15f54249cfb97f32203ff46089f6a8d8b1","number":121426,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Rename `method` parameter to `callable` in many Array methods","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Guess who forgot to make a PR **8 months ago**. I think it was because I wanted to tweak the surrounding documentation, but it wasn't strictly necessary for the purposes of this PR.\r\nSimilar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113217\r\n\r\nThe title is self-explanatory. This PR renames the `method` parameter to `callable` in many Array methods. It does _not_ change the signatures of the underlying C++ methods ~~in order to reduce some diff noise, unless requested~~ **because it was already changed to `p_callable`**.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nArray's `filter`, `map`, `all` etc. These methods were added at a time where **Callable** was being figured out (early Godot `4.0`). It doesn't take much to realize why the parameter's name is disgusting, but I will nonetheless:\r\n- It's exceedingly misleading.\r\n- It implies that only methods can be passed.\r\n- If not the above, it implies that all \"callables\" are referred to as \"methods\".\r\n\t- \"_[param method] is a callable that_\" 🤢 \r\n- It muddies the context between \"this method\" and \"the parameter named `method`\"\r\n\r\nPossible alternative names include `callback`.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_ur